### Health
http://localhost:5000/health

### OpenAPI document (JSON)
http://localhost:5000/openapi/v1.json

### Scalar API reference (open in browser)
http://localhost:5000/docs

### Get Movies (first page)
http://localhost:5000/api/movies

### Get Movies (second page - keyset continues after "Coco", the 20th movie by title)
http://localhost:5000/api/movies?lastKnownMovieId=85754775-a8f8-86c7-c83c-0f5e7e732e96

### Get Movies (third page - keyset continues after "Interstellar", the 40th movie by title)
http://localhost:5000/api/movies?lastKnownMovieId=64c93d64-c25f-4e7b-8b33-317a5a90e5b5

### Get Movies (invalid parameters)
http://localhost:5000/api/movies?lastKnownMovieId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&take=-1

### Get Movies (unknown movie)
http://localhost:5000/api/movies?lastKnownMovieID=78847C1F-E9BB-4D1A-8434-529BC8C68134

### PUT Matrix Comment
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/moviesRatings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "B507182E-F9FF-48D7-8A78-BCDC15CB4D0A",
    "movieId": "5C200E1D-4A16-4572-B884-E3A3957771FC",
    "userName": "Trinity",
    "comment": "The Answer Is Out There, Neo. It's Looking for You.",
    "rating": 5
}

### Put Comment for Non-Existing Movie
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/moviesRatings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "365B0BCC-37B0-4B91-83B4-638DF7AC9DCF",
    "movieId": "92B2AEA9-495C-4ECC-91C6-46D27C0FA5A3",
    "userName": "Mr. FatFinger",
    "comment": "I think I fat-fingered again",
    "rating": 2
}


### Invalid Put Comment
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/moviesRatings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "817D7225-80EE-4C88-A9EC-682CCBDA75F2",
    "movieId": "42A94A99-92F6-B603-D675-87E211E0C665",
    "userName": " ",
    "comment": null,
    "rating": -23
}

### New Movie
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "movieId": "BCAE7EBA-C09B-4F1D-9406-1C8909919E48",
    "movieName": "Star Wars - A New Hope"
}
